(7675048, 1254222, 103142, '<td valign="top">I love the photo and the idea, but not crazy about the processing. Everything is looking a little too orange for  me. <br/> <br/>Also, what would be an absolutely stunning image is if you got rid of everything except the curved branch with the birds. I could see that being something to hang on a wall. :)</td>', 'I love the photo and the idea, but not crazy about the processing. Everything is looking a little too orange for  me.  Also, what would be an absolutely stunning image is if you got rid of everything except the curved branch with the birds. I could see that being something to hang on a wall. :)', '2020-09-21 19:59:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7675049, 1253883, 103142, '<td valign="top">Hi. I like the photo, but maybe it''s because I''ve seen the filter too much... It just doesn''t seem to add to it. Or perhaps just using it on the wall, and not the headboard, etc. <br/> <br/>The colors are really nice, though, and I like the lighting from the blinds</td>', 'Hi. I like the photo, but maybe it''s because I''ve seen the filter too much... It just doesn''t seem to add to it. Or perhaps just using it on the wall, and not the headboard, etc.  The colors are really nice, though, and I like the lighting from the blinds', '2020-09-21 20:01:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7675050, 1253827, 103142, '<td valign="top">I hear twilight zone music. :)</td>', 'I hear twilight zone music. :)', '2020-09-21 20:01:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7675051, 1254082, 103142, '<td valign="top">fascinating shot. The eyes look a little manic. What''s kind of creepy, is the police arm coming in from the left almost looked like a gun at first glance.<br/> <br/>Lots to find here. -8-</td>', 'fascinating shot. The eyes look a little manic. What''s kind of creepy, is the police arm coming in from the left almost looked like a gun at first glance. Lots to find here. -8-', '2020-09-21 20:02:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7675052, 1254172, 103142, '<td valign="top">Not crazy about filters made to look like paintings. But either this is a painting, or it did a really cool job on a photograph. I honestly don''t know what I''m looking at</td>', 'Not crazy about filters made to look like paintings. But either this is a painting, or it did a really cool job on a photograph. I honestly don''t know what I''m looking at', '2020-09-21 20:03:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7675053, 1254164, 103142, '<td valign="top">Nice tones, nice setup. But for some reason I''m wanting more. It seems like there could be something to take this from nice to incredible. I don''t know if it needs a little more interesting lighting, or a lower angle, or even just cropping in from the sides a tad. Something is holding this back. -7- but it seems like it could have been an 8 or a 9. <br/> <br/>I''d love to see this in a discussion thread afterwards. Because everything is technically beautiful. I''m not sure what would put it over the top.</td>', 'Nice tones, nice setup. But for some reason I''m wanting more. It seems like there could be something to take this from nice to incredible. I don''t know if it needs a little more interesting lighting, or a lower angle, or even just cropping in from the sides a tad. Something is holding this back. -7- but it seems like it could have been an 8 or a 9.  I''d love to see this in a discussion thread afterwards. Because everything is technically beautiful. I''m not sure what would put it over the top.', '2020-09-21 20:06:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7675054, 1254072, 103142, '<td valign="top">This is really quite beautiful! I thought it was rather nice, and as I was getting ready to vote, it really started hitting me how wonderful it is. It went from a 7 to a 9 quite quickly. And I''m not sure exactly why. But I''m finding it quite wonderful.</td>', 'This is really quite beautiful! I thought it was rather nice, and as I was getting ready to vote, it really started hitting me how wonderful it is. It went from a 7 to a 9 quite quickly. And I''m not sure exactly why. But I''m finding it quite wonderful.', '2020-09-21 20:08:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7675055, 1254043, 103142, '<td valign="top">The placement of the cracks is really quite nice, along with the blue toning. However, it seems like there should be distortion or discontinuation of the photo in the empty areas. It loses it''s impact when you see the image where the image shouldn''t be.</td>', 'The placement of the cracks is really quite nice, along with the blue toning. However, it seems like there should be distortion or discontinuation of the photo in the empty areas. It loses it''s impact when you see the image where the image shouldn''t be.', '2020-09-21 20:10:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7675056, 1253879, 103142, '<td valign="top">something is wrong with your lighting and the wraps. The barbed wire seems to be floating just in front with an occasional attempt at forcing the wrap, and the lighting on her doesn''t match the background lighting. <br/> <br/>Interesting idea, interesting title, but the photoshopping isn''t working for me.</td>', 'something is wrong with your lighting and the wraps. The barbed wire seems to be floating just in front with an occasional attempt at forcing the wrap, and the lighting on her doesn''t match the background lighting.  Interesting idea, interesting title, but the photoshopping isn''t working for me.', '2020-09-21 20:12:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7675057, 1254211, 103142, '<td valign="top">Sweet shot. Seems oversharpened (the water is a bit painful and there''s a white line on the birds back and under neck), and though I''m continuously doing the same thing, I wish it wasn''t cropped in so tight. A little more space around would help give more context.</td>', 'Sweet shot. Seems oversharpened (the water is a bit painful and there''s a white line on the birds back and under neck), and though I''m continuously doing the same thing, I wish it wasn''t cropped in so tight. A little more space around would help give more context.', '2020-09-21 20:14:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7675058, 1254253, 103142, '<td valign="top">It''s the title that makes it and pulls it up a point</td>', 'It''s the title that makes it and pulls it up a point', '2020-09-21 20:15:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7675059, 1254150, 103142, '<td valign="top">I keep seeing these textures, and I don''t think they add that much (sorry). I love the sink and the hands, but the texture on the arms just looks weird and draws my eye there.</td>', 'I keep seeing these textures, and I don''t think they add that much (sorry). I love the sink and the hands, but the texture on the arms just looks weird and draws my eye there.', '2020-09-21 20:16:54.000000', NULL, 1),
