(7675138, 1254164, 24454, '<td valign="top">Well...Im going on the record as thinking there is absolutely nothing that could put this image over the top because it already IS over the top!  Its perfection!  The lighting, the tones that give it a vintage, museum-quality painting feel.  The gorgeous, obedient dog!!!   I can rarely get my dogs to look at the camera when Im holding their treat over the camera!  To have a to-die-for bone on a human plate, just for them... ha!  Theyd be on that bone so fast, Id easier get a shot of a hummingbird over that bone!   Congratulations!  This was the one I gave top honors to in this challenge!<br/></td>', 'Well...Im going on the record as thinking there is absolutely nothing that could put this image over the top because it already IS over the top!  Its perfection!  The lighting, the tones that give it a vintage, museum-quality painting feel.  The gorgeous, obedient dog!!!   I can rarely get my dogs to look at the camera when Im holding their treat over the camera!  To have a to-die-for bone on a human plate, just for them... ha!  Theyd be on that bone so fast, Id easier get a shot of a hummingbird over that bone!   Congratulations!  This was the one I gave top honors to in this challenge!', '2020-09-22 14:18:47.000000', NULL, 0),
